Subject: [PATCH] consensus: enforce base consensus rules from genesis and
 remove eCash activations

Enforce base consensus rules from height 0 and remove historical eCash fork
activation heights.

Original-Commit: 781c4c8448181a9bd668b506d50f6aa2d72715d9
Original-Patch: v2/001
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

Plan-v2 owner repair: Lane B native adaptation: retain the shared reconstruction/selection and unconditional sequence-lock checks while preserving native header, transaction, and state-root behavior.

(cherry picked from commit e5affd12b04513eafe05b70544fe14d3ef559649)

Canonical-Source-Commit: e5affd12b04513eafe05b70544fe14d3ef559649

